{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）上午8時許，港鐵表示香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，港島綫列車服務受阻，來往堅尼地城站及柴灣站的整體行車時間需要額外時間。直至上午10時半，港鐵表示信號設備故障已修復，港島綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p><figure><img alt=\"香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199646029176115200561397.jpeg/03MogEqDigzuhTZMPpOuBlnzPqQvMbbOauXw0Wrl8NE\"/><figcaption>香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:04:34.334414+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:51:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:57:35.586281+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:58:06.783200+00:00","content_hash":"b2f8b6a1cf7c4f92c20219b9af9336934bf433e2a1b7d7fc627a5ba771a56c9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}